{
  "sn55.25:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 55.25 ",
  "sn55.25:0.2": "3. Saraṇānivagga ",
  "sn55.25:0.3": "Dutiyasaraṇānisakkasutta ",
  "sn55.25:1.1": "Kapilavatthunidānaṁ. ",
  "sn55.25:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena saraṇāni sakko kālaṅkato hoti. ",
  "sn55.25:1.3": "So bhagavatā byākato: ",
  "sn55.25:1.4": "“sotāpanno avinipātadhammo niyato sambodhiparāyaṇo”ti. ",
  "sn55.25:1.5": "Tatra sudaṁ sambahulā sakkā saṅgamma samāgamma ujjhāyanti khīyanti vipācenti: ",
  "sn55.25:1.6": "“acchariyaṁ vata bho, abbhutaṁ vata bho. ",
  "sn55.25:1.7": "Ettha dāni ko na sotāpanno bhavissati. ",
  "sn55.25:1.8": "Yatra hi nāma saraṇāni sakko kālaṅkato. ",
  "sn55.25:1.9": "So bhagavatā byākato: ",
  "sn55.25:1.10": "‘sotāpanno avinipātadhammo niyato sambodhiparāyaṇo’ti. ",
  "sn55.25:1.11": "Saraṇāni sakko sikkhāya aparipūrakārī ahosī”ti. ",
  "sn55.25:1.12": "Atha kho mahānāmo sakko yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho mahānāmo sakko bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn55.25:2.1": "“Idha, bhante, saraṇāni sakko kālaṅkato. ",
  "sn55.25:2.2": "So bhagavatā byākato: ",
  "sn55.25:2.3": "‘sotāpanno avinipātadhammo niyato sambodhiparāyaṇo’ti. ",
  "sn55.25:2.4": "Tatra sudaṁ, bhante, sambahulā sakkā saṅgamma samāgamma ujjhāyanti khīyanti vipācenti: ",
  "sn55.25:2.5": "‘acchariyaṁ vata bho, abbhutaṁ vata bho. ",
  "sn55.25:2.6": "Ettha dā